{
 "comment": [
  "What every helper's redaction must do, whatever its language and regex engine: for each case, `text` joined becomes `expected` joined, where {redacted} stands for redactors.json's `placeholder`.",
  "Texts are split into fragments so that no line of this file holds anything shaped like a real key; the bodies are made up."
